From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Raphael Display Prototype <raphael-display-prototype@localhost>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 13:59:24 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(display): replay Raphael Linux 5.4 support

Build the SDM core and SDE backend from the same source tree and target headers. Preserve the DRM-only factory, the SM8150 ABI and the rotation fallback. The pps socket stays in the Raphael device tree.

Replays local display ac0791d7e56e without fork CI metadata. Backend snapshot originally ported from erg-raphael-5-4/android_hardware_qcom_display_sm8150 at 00463c1df86de606cdf893c238d4d9c93f3a6a51; retain its copyright and license notices.
